#25500
&08The Nine Hells&00 -~
I've temporarily added a series of Nine gates that will allow mortals to
enter the First plane of Hell, Avernus. This will be removed upon once
portals are fixed by Vex or Digger, making the River Styx the future link zone for 
8 of the Nine Hells. The bottom level will only be accessible by going through
the 8th plane.

Each Gate will require a key from a Priest of Hell, these priests will
be randomly scattered about the mud..so players will have to find them
.

Kurse - APril 99
~
