#25501
The Path to the After~
   As you step into this long, dark hallway, you hear a muffled sound. Looking
behind you, you see that the entrance you walked through is nowhere to be
seen. It appears you are trapped. Resigning yourself to explore, you take
a rotted old torch off the wall and light its musty cloth wick.......
You wish you hadn't. The light of the torch illuminates the floor and walls,
showing you that they are covered with thousands, no millions of bugs.
In the far distance you think you see some type of doorway, but to reach it
you are going to have to tread a long 'carpet' of squishing, crunching,
insectoid life. With your teeth grit, you take your first step..*crunch*.
~
