#25502
The First Gate to Hell~
   You come to the end of the hallway and step into a large circular 
clearing. Looking back, you notice once again that the walls have sealed your
exit. Before you stands what you could only describe as a 'gateway'.
The gate is composed of a large free standing disk of polished obsidian
about twenty feet in diamater. Down its center you notice a thin seam, which
you suspect is how it opens. Centrally located near the bottom of the disk is
a single square gold keyplate and keyhole. You notice the keyplate has
been carved into the shape of a large multi-headed Dragon.
~
