#25503
The Second Gate to Hell~
   You step through the gate and find yourself in another room similar to
the previous. The room is encompassed by another Gate, identical in shape
and size the the first. Peculiarly, This gate has no keyplate, just a single
hole located centrally near its center.
You notice that it is rather hard to catch your breath in here. Are the walls
closing in on you?
~
