#25504
The Third Gate to Hell~
   You step through the gate and find yourself in a chamber much like the 
last. Once again, your exit is nowhere to be seen, sealing you (and your
fate) within the confines of this place. A large circular disk of obsidian
stands against the front of the chamber, looking menacing and alien to you.
Walking up a small set of steps to the base of the gateway, you find a single
brass keyplate and keyhole, engraved in a strange language which you can
not read, but feel is diabolic in its origin.
Upon reaching the top step, a mind-numbing fog is released from holes in
the walls, causing your body to shake in an uncontrollable fear.
~
