#25505
The Fourth Gate to Hell~
   You step through the gate and find yourself face to face with another large
gateway. It is identical to the previous, except that its obsidian face is
streaked with cracks of reddish stone, giving it a bleeding appearance.
You ascend a small set of stone steps to the base of the gateway and inspect
the keyplate and keyhole. As you run your fingers over the strange sigils
on the plate, you hear faint hissing.....
~
