#25506
The Fifth Gate to Hell~
   You step through the Fourth Gate and find yourself in a chamber slightly
different than the previous four. It seems as if you have entered some type of
transparent 'bubble'. Flowing all about the outside of the bubble are waters
of the blackest night, giving you the strange sensation you are underwater.
With a very uneasy feeling you step up to the gateway and peer at the
keyplate. Engraved upon it is a relief depicting a hooded figure piloting
a small skiff over the waters of some river. It is as you realize with horror
that you may be 'in' the River Styx that you see inky trails of water 
leaking in from the floor. Out of here fast!
~
