#25507
The Sixth Gate to Hell~
   To your relief you it seems you are no longer in peril, though you
worry about what other traps may lay ahead. This chamber is again like the 
first few, with the large obsidian gateway dominating the chamber. You
suddenly wonder to yourself, 'where are we?'..given that you seemed to be
beneath the River Styx itself before, where do these chambers actually
exist? Perhaps you will find out through this gateway. Now where was that
key?
~
