#25508
The Seventh Gate to Hell~
   You step through the gateway and enter yet another circular chamber. Lit 
torches are mounted at evenly spaced intervals across the wall. The gateway
stands before you, and seems to emanate a low hum, which gives you a headache.
As you begin to walk towards the keyhole, the humming gives way to a low
whine, which becomes louder and louder as you approach the base of the disk.
You reach its base and notice that you are bleeding quite profusely from the
nose, the whine thrumming in your head like a thousand chariots. You begin
to feel dizzy..the lights seem to flicker...open the gate while you still can.
~
