#25509
The Eighth Gate to Hell~
   Upon stepping inside the gate, the intense pain in your head subsides and
your vision clears once more. This chamber is larger than the others you
have been in, and seems to be decorated with numerous pentagrams and
other symbols of evil. The gateway stands before you, flanked on either side
by a brass brazier burning wildly. You know that you are drawing close to the
end of this journey, for you can not shake this growing feeling of fear and
foreboding. You hadn't noticed it so much before, but you realize that you
Don't want to go through any more gateways. You steel your nerves and 
step towards the gate..perhaps it will take you home.
~
