#25510
The Ninth Gate to Hell~
   If each gate is symbolic of each dread Layer of Hell, then you stand before
the final gate. Beyond should lie the Nine Hells themselves, which the
cult of Nine have guarded in secrecy for Millenia. The massive obsidian
gateway stands impassively before you, as if awaiting to be awakened and its
secrets unlocked. You begin to ascend the series of stone steps up to the base
of the disk where the keyhole lies, knowing full well that you may be seeing
the world of Raven for the last time.
~
